{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built for speed. Designed for precision. This is racing stripped down to its core\u2014just you, the track, and the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this sci-fi time trial demo, you\u2019ll take on five high-speed tracks with nothing in your way except your own limits. There are no opponents, no explosions\u2014just clean, responsive handling and the brutal pursuit of a faster lap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every second matters. Every mistake sticks. The difference between a smooth run and a reset is often a single input too late. Your biggest enemy? Your own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is about learning the lines, trusting your instincts, and pushing past your plateau. Instant restarts keep the momentum going, and tight controls mean no excuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a taste of what\u2019s coming. More tracks. More features. But for now\u2014just drive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900610?t=1754075282","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900610?t=1754075282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900610/c650d23f15ec53c5b9c9cbf90d23f3b1afdaead7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754075282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900610/c650d23f15ec53c5b9c9cbf90d23f3b1afdaead7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754075282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built for speed. Designed for precision. This is racing stripped 